  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Consider&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is an odd function.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
